{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And he said:</b> Moses, <b>If hearing you will hear</b> etc. The Holy One, blessed be He, says to you: every illness that I placed upon Egypt etc. <b>To the voice of YHWH your Elohim</b> — a tag of the lamed." "<b>I will not place upon you.</b> For if I place it, it is upon Me to trouble to remove it from you." "<b>For I am YHWH your healer.</b> Since you will listen to My voice — like I healed the waters, which no physician has ability apart from Him."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "The word 'Moses' appears between the two parts of the lemma; placed here as in the Hebrew. 'Tag of the lamed' refers to the cantillation mark on לקול."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:06.413517173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}